flowchart TD
    A[Planned household withdrawal] --> B[Review tax position and available reserve]
    B --> C[Sell appropriate holding if needed]
    C --> D[Confirm cash availability and withdrawal conditions]
    D --> E[Compare necessary currency conversion and transfer]
    E --> F[Withdraw through supported account route]
